      "contentPreview": "P6 seam gotchas: FileMemoryStore is \u0060public sealed partial class\u0060, so its forwarding members MUST be non-virtual (a \u0060virtual\u0060 member on a sealed type is CS0549). The \u0060virtual\u0060 keyword lives on FakeMemoryStore (a separate IMemoryStore do-not-inherit double) \u2014 test subclasses like ListScopedCompletenessTests.PagedFakeStore override via FakeMemoryStore, NOT FileMemoryStore. IncludesEphemeral is static on the service, so store callers must qualify it as TopicDiscoveryService.IncludesEphemeral(...) (",
